# Font Awesome Pro packages resolve from Font Awesome's own registry.
# The credential deliberately does NOT live here: pnpm refuses to expand
# environment variables in registry auth that comes from a committed
# project-level .npmrc. It comes from ~/.npmrc locally and from
# `pnpm config set ... --location=user` in CI. See docs/migration-plan.md §2.5.
@fortawesome:registry=https://npm.fontawesome.com/
